 R←Test_33(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;api;p1;p2;apiNames;public
⍝ The API functions `CreateParms`, `History`, `Version` and `SetTrap` behave like their internal counterparts
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 api←##.HandleError.API

 apiNames←api.⎕NL-3
 public←##.HandleError.Public
 →T.PassesIf∧/apiNames∊public
 →T.PassesIf∧/public∊apiNames

 →T.PassesIf api.Version≡##.HandleError.Version
 →T.PassesIf api.History≡##.HandleError.History

 p1←api.CreateParms
 p2←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 →T.PassesIf 9=⎕NC'p1'
 →T.PassesIf(p1.⎕NL 2)≡p2.⎕NL 2

 #.⎕SHADOW'HandleErrorParms'
 #.HandleErrorParms←api.CreateParms
 →T.PassesIf(1 api.SetTrap ⍬)≡1 ##.HandleError.SetTrap ⍬
 →T.PassesIf(api.SetTrap ⍬)≡##.HandleError.SetTrap ⍬
 →T.PassesIf(1 api.SetTrap'#.HandleErrorParms')≡1 ##.HandleError.SetTrap'#.HandleErrorParms'
 :Trap 11
     {}api.SetTrap #.HandleErrorParms
     →T.PassesIf 0
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK
